---
description: POS inventory and receipt safety rules.
globs: **/*.{cs,ts,tsx,js,jsx,sql,md}
alwaysApply: false
---

Receipt snapshots are immutable.
Reprint must not mutate sale, payment, receipt, or stock.
Product edit must not change stock quantity.
Stock changes must go through stock-in, stock-adjustment, checkout commit, or approved void reversal.
Every stock mutation must leave evidence.
